---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="What Is The Cosmos">
  <div class="about-portal">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">What Is The Cosmos?</p>
      <h1>A universe of music,<br /><em>stories, lore, and discovery.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        The Cosmos is formed from Levels and Folds—distinct realities that exist together without surrendering what makes each one its own.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="principle-grid" aria-label="Cosmos principles">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h2>Music begins it.</h2>
        <p>Every journey starts with an emotional signal. The music opens the door before the answers arrive.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h2>Stories give it a path.</h2>
        <p>Characters and worlds are encountered through their stories, not handed over as an encyclopedia.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h2>Discovery makes it yours.</h2>
        <p>Your Personal Journey remembers what you have reached and reveals the Cosmos in the order you earn it.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="public-law">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The Public Doorway</p>
        <h2>You may see every coordinate.<br />You do not begin with every answer.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="law-copy">
        <p>
          Every known Level and Fold may be visible from the public site. Their important discoveries remain inside the Journey.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>12_15 is the open universe.</strong> Its audience-facing music, artists, stories, imagery, and lore are available to everyone.
        </p>
        <a href="/#worlds">See the known coordinates <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="creative-order">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Creative Order</p>
      <div class="order-line" aria-label="Music, then Stories, then Lore, then Cosmos">
        <span>Music</span><i>→</i><span>Stories</span><i>→</i><span>Lore</span><i>→</i><span>Cosmos</span>
      </div>
      <p>The emotional source comes first. The larger structure grows from what the music and stories have earned.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-entry">
      <p>There is more here than the public surface can show.</p>
      <h2>Choose the open door—or begin your own Journey.</h2>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="primary" href="/lore/level-12-fold-15">Enter Open 12_15 <span>→</span></a>
        <a class="secondary" href="/#journey">Your Personal Journey <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-portal {
    position: relative;
    width: min(92rem, calc(100% - 2rem));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem) 0 8rem;
  }

  .about-hero {
    max-width: 69rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #d5ad59;
    font: 800 .67rem/1 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    letter-spacing: .25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    color: #f1eadc;
    font: 600 clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.7rem)/.97 Georgia, serif;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
  }

  h1 em {
    color: transparent;
    font-weight: 400;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(224, 191, 120, .68);
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
    color: #a6b0c2;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .principle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    margin-top: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 182, 206, .17);
    background: rgba(5, 7, 14, .72);
  }

  .principle-grid article {
    min-height: 20rem;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(168, 182, 206, .17);
  }

  .principle-grid article:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .principle-grid span { color: #a67ed6; font: 800 .65rem/1 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .15em; }
  .principle-grid h2 { margin: 5rem 0 1rem; color: #eee6d8; font: italic 500 2rem/1.1 Georgia, serif; }
  .principle-grid p { margin: 0; color: #909caf; line-height: 1.75; }

  .public-law {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem);
    align-items: start;
    padding: clamp(6rem, 11vw, 10rem) clamp(1rem, 5vw, 5rem);
  }

  .public-law h2,
  .creative-order h2,
  .about-entry h2 {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: #eee7db;
    font: 500 clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 4.25rem)/1.05 Georgia, serif;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }

  .law-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: #a3aec0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .law-copy strong { color: #edcb77; }
  .law-copy a { color: #ddba68; font: 800 .65rem/1.3 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; }
  .law-copy a span { margin-left: .45rem; }

  .creative-order {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 170, 78, .28);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 40%, rgba(89, 45, 155, .14), transparent 27rem),
      rgba(8, 8, 14, .86);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .order-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: clamp(.8rem, 2vw, 2rem);
    margin: 2.4rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .order-line span { color: #efe3c6; font: italic 500 clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.6rem)/1 Georgia, serif; }
  .order-line i { color: #8a6daf; font-style: normal; }
  .creative-order > p:last-child { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; color: #8f9aad; line-height: 1.75; }

  .about-entry {
    max-width: 65rem;
    margin: clamp(6rem, 11vw, 10rem) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-entry > p { color: #8b95a7; font: italic 400 1.15rem/1.5 Georgia, serif; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2.4rem; }
  .actions a { min-width: 15rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border: 1px solid rgba(214, 171, 78, .5); font: 800 .66rem/1.2 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; }
  .actions .primary { color: #140e05; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #efda94, #d89e3a); }
  .actions .secondary { color: #e9dfca; background: rgba(8, 9, 16, .8); }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .principle-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .principle-grid article { min-height: 14rem; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(168, 182, 206, .17); }
    .principle-grid h2 { margin-top: 2.8rem; }
    .public-law { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .about-portal { width: calc(100% - 1rem); }
    .creative-order { padding: 3rem 1.25rem; }
    .actions a { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
